glossary.definition:
(O) "Licensor" means one of the following:

(1) A board of health approved under section 3717.11 of the Revised Code;

(2) The director of agriculture acting pursuant to section 3717.11 of the Revised Code with respect to the licensing of retail food establishments;

(3) The director of health acting pursuant to section 3717.11 of the Revised Code with respect to the licensing of food service operations.
